[2026-05-10T20:14:39.981Z] [INFO] 2026-05-10T20:14:39.981118Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019e136f-2e57-71e1-87c0-be8b241fe84c}:submission_dispatch{otel.name="op.dispatch.user_input_with_turn_context" submission.id="019e136f-2ef0-7801-ae42-abf3b6a7ef72" codex.op="user_input_with_turn_context"}:turn{otel.name="session_task.turn" thread.id=019e136f-2e57-71e1-87c0-be8b241fe84c turn.id=019e136f-2ef0-7801-ae42-abf3b6a7ef72 model=gpt-5.5 codex.turn.reasoning_effort=xhigh}: codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec_command {"cmd":"cat > /tmp/pr-65-body.md <<'EOF'\nCloses https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/issues/33\n\n## Summary\n\n- Added the Sportzania Vue workspace shell at `/:database/sportzania/:workspace` with tabs for task dashboard, rating, org structure, and the explicit ProcVac fallback.\n- Ported `taskdash`, `rating`, and `struct` from `templates/sportzania/*` with the legacy report ids, JSON_KV contracts, filters, aggregation helpers, and fixtures.\n- Added legacy aliases for `/:database/taskdash`, `/:database/rating`, `/:database/struct`, and `/:database/procvac`.\n- Documented the full Sportzania template inventory and the ProcVac fallback boundary in `docs/SPORTZANIA_WORKSPACES.md`.\n\n## Reproduction / Verification\n\n- Open `/:database/sportzania/taskdash`, `/:database/sportzania/rating`, `/:database/sportzania/struct`, and `/:database/sportzania/procvac`.\n- Legacy aliases redirect to the matching Sportzania Vue routes while preserving query/hash state.\n- ProcVac remains an explicit fallback because its `js/procvac.js` and `css/procvac.css` bundle is tracked by issue #32.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `npm test`\n- `npm run build`\n- `npm run test:e2e -- e2e/sportzania.spec.ts`\n\n## Screenshots\n\n![Sportzania task dashboard](https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/blob/issue-33-c3f5bf9165c3/docs/screenshots/sportzania-taskdash.png?raw=true)\n\n![Sportzania rating](https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/blob/issue-33-c3f5bf9165c3/docs/screenshots/sportzania-rating.png?raw=true)\n\n![Sportzania structure](https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/blob/issue-33-c3f5bf9165c3/docs/screenshots/sportzania-struct.png?raw=true)\nEOF\ngh pr edit 65 --repo ideav/vue-gram --title \"Перенести Sportzania рабочие места\" --body-file /tmp/pr-65-body.md","workdir":"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1778442495970","yield_time_ms":1000,"max_output_tokens":12000} thread_id=019e136f-2e57-71e1-87c0-be8b241fe84c
